{"id":"8ae23e6f000106e1","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-completeness-soundness.md","title":"Protocol Completeness and Soundness","display":"df-completeness-soundness — Protocol Completeness and Soundness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-completeness-soundness","aliases":["28-df-completeness-soundness","Completeness and Soundness"],"display":"df-completeness-soundness — Protocol Completeness and Soundness","depends_on":["[[28-df-interactive-transcript]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 8.6, completeness and soundness clauses","source_printed_pages":"146–147","source_pdf_pages":"172–173","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-completeness-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-completeness-soundness</span><span>Completeness and Soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-completeness-soundness — Protocol Completeness and Soundness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3e270c20bc5033b3\" href=\"?note=3e270c20bc5033b3\" title=\"28-df-interactive-transcript\">28-df-interactive-transcript</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 8.6, completeness and soundness clauses"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"146–147"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"172–173"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}\">\\(V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}\">\\(\\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e270c20bc5033b3\" href=\"?note=3e270c20bc5033b3\" title=\"28-df-interactive-transcript\">28-df-interactive-transcript</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi=(P,V)\">\\(\\Pi=(P,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,s\\in[0,1]\">\\(c,s\\in[0,1]\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CS}_{c,s}(\\Pi,L)\\leftrightarrow(\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}(x)\\ge c)\\land(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L\\ \\forall P^*\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P^*,V}(x)\\le s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CS}_{c,s}(\\Pi,L)\\leftrightarrow(\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}(x)\\ge c)\\land(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L\\ \\forall P^*\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P^*,V}(x)\\le s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>定义允许任意参数，非平凡证明系统还要求 c&gt;s。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 8.6, completeness and soundness clauses，印刷页 146–147；PDF 页 172–173。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-interactive-transcript","status":"resolved","id":"3e270c20bc5033b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-interactive-transcript]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-interactive-transcript","status":"resolved","id":"3e270c20bc5033b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}$、$P\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b$、$\\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}$ 见 [[28-df-interactive-transcript]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi=(P,V)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"c,s\\in[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CS}_{c,s}(\\Pi,L)\\leftrightarrow(\\forall x\\in L\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}(x)\\ge c)\\land(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L\\ \\forall P^*\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{P^*,V}(x)\\le s).","display":true}],"bytes":1393,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"交互协议：[[28-df-interactive-transcript]]、[[28-df-completeness-soundness]]、[[28-df-ip]]、[[28-df-am]]、[[28-df-ma]]、[[28-df-mip]]。"}],"outgoing":["3e270c20bc5033b3"]}